LOCATION:The Meru Sanur
DESCRIPTION:From 18-20 December\, Beautiverse 2026 returns to Bali\, once a
 gain taking place at The Meru Sanur – Bali Beach Convention Centre\, und
 er the theme ‘Green Beauty for the Future of Wellbeing.’ This year\, B
 eautiverse explores the evolution of the beauty industry towards a more ho
 listic\, conscious\, and technology-driven approach. Over the three-day ev
 ent\, visitors can experience brand showcases\, expert-led discussions\, n
 etworking opportunities\, and curated activities. The event also provides 
 a platform for industry stakeholders to exchange ideas\, build partnership
 s\, and explore new opportunities across the beauty and wellness sectors. 
 Featuring AI Ambassadors Tara\, Bea\, and Vexa as key highlights\, Beautiv
 erse introduces an innovative digital dimension to the experience. Beyond 
 engaging audiences\, these digital ambassadors reflect the growing relatio
 nship between artificial intelligence and the beauty and wellness industri
 es. The Beautiverse App complements this initiative by providing informati
 on on the event\, participating brands\, programmes\, and activities\, cre
 ating a more interactive experience for visitors.\n\nMore info: https://ww
 w.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/beautiverse-2026-green-beauty-for-the-futu
